  "notes": "2027: Jump Into Summer mini camp June 14 to 18 ($700), then an 8 week program June 21 to August 13 (closed July 5). Families pick any 4 or more weeks: 4 weeks $3,940, 5 weeks $4,485, 6 weeks $4,870, 7 weeks $5,200, 8 weeks $5,475. Counselor in Training program (ages 14 to 15) $1,600. Partial week options for 4 year olds. Hours 9 am to 3:30 pm. Tuition includes lunch, snacks, T-shirt and field trips. A $200 deposit at registration goes toward tuition. Sibling discounts 5% and 10%. Lower camp meets on the Newtown Friends School campus. Registration opens December 15, 2026.",
